:name: bao1x
:description: Baochip-1x machine (see docs/01-hardware-dossier.md)

# Usage:
#   renode emulation/renode/bao1x.resc                       (interactive)
#   $bin=@path/to/image.elf renode ... (or set $bin before including)

using sysbus
path add $ORIGIN
mach create "bao1x"

# Custom peripheral models must be compiled before the platform loads
i @peripherals/Bao1xDuart.cs
i @peripherals/Bao1xIrqArray.cs
i @peripherals/Bao1xLiteXTimer.cs
i @peripherals/Bao1xTickTimer.cs
i @peripherals/Bao1xUdmaCtrl.cs
i @peripherals/Bao1xUdmaUart.cs

machine LoadPlatformDescription @bao1x.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset
